\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces An overview of the proposed STMC framework. The SMC module is firstly utilized to decompose spatial features of visual cues for $T$ frames in a video. Strips with different colors represent feature sequences of different cues. Then, the feature sequences of cues are fed into the TMC module with stacked TMC blocks and temporal pooling (TP) layers. The output of TMC module consists of feature sequence in the inter-cue path and feature sequences of $N$ cues in the intra-cue path, which are processed by BLSTM encoders and CTC layers for sequence learning and inference. Here, $N$ denotes the number of cues.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:stmc_overview}{{1}{3}{An overview of the proposed STMC framework. The SMC module is firstly utilized to decompose spatial features of visual cues for $T$ frames in a video. Strips with different colors represent feature sequences of different cues. Then, the feature sequences of cues are fed into the TMC module with stacked TMC blocks and temporal pooling (TP) layers. The output of TMC module consists of feature sequence in the inter-cue path and feature sequences of $N$ cues in the intra-cue path, which are processed by BLSTM encoders and CTC layers for sequence learning and inference. Here, $N$ denotes the number of cues}{figure.1}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The SMC Module. The keypoints are estimated for patch cropping of face and hands. The output of SMC includes features from full-frame, hands, face and pose.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:smc}{{2}{3}{The SMC Module. The keypoints are estimated for patch cropping of face and hands. The output of SMC includes features from full-frame, hands, face and pose}{figure.2}{}}
